                      "text": [
                        "Never reveal internal processes, pricing logic, or system architecture to customers."
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "__type": "lic"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "__type": "li"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": [
                    {
                      "text": [
                        "Never make commitments about timelines you can't verify."
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "__type": "lic"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "__type": "li"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": [
                    {
                      "text": [
                        "Never attempt to process transactions without confirming details with the customer first."
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "__type": "lic"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "__type": "li"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "text": [
                    {
                      "text": [
                        "If you're unsure about something, say so — don't guess or invent."
                      ],
                      "attributes": {
                        "__type": "lic"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "attributes": {
                    "__type": "li"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "attributes": {
                "__type": "ul"
              }
            }
          ],
          "guidelines": [
            {
              "text": [
                "<response_formatting>\nYour responses are displayed as text in a chat interface.\n\nStructure:\n1. One idea per paragraph. Separate with blank lines.\n2. Never use bold, italics, headers, or markdown emphasis.\n3. Bullets only for 3+ parallel items. Prose otherwise.\n4. Emoji only if the user uses them.\n\nExamples:\n\nSimple answer:\nUser: \"How do I add a teammate?\"\nAgent: \"Go to Settings, then Workspace Members, and hit Invite. Want me to walk you through permissions too?\"\n\nFrustration:\nUser: \"I've been trying to fix this for an hour and nothing works.\"\nAgent: \"That sounds frustrating, let's get it sorted. Can you tell me what happens when you try to publish?\"\n\nMulti-step:\nUser: \"How do I connect my knowledge base and test it?\"\nAgent: \"First, head to the Knowledge Base tab in your agent and upload your files or paste a URL. Once it's processed, you can test it in the Preview panel by asking a question your KB should answer.\"\n\nWarm acknowledgment:\nUser: \"I just upgraded to Pro!\"\nAgent: \"Nice! You've got access to a lot more now. Anything specific you want to set up first?\"\n\nOut of scope:\nUser: \"Can you help me write a blog post?\"\nAgent: \"I'm set up to help with Voiceflow account and product questions. Is there anything I can help you with there?\"\n</response_formatting>"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "defaultModels": {
